          <h1>AI-Driven<br /><em>Market Microstructure</em></h1>
          <p class="hero-subtitle">in Centralized and Decentralized Finance</p>
          <p class="hero-description">A workshop bringing together researchers and practitioners to explore how artificial intelligence is reshaping trading, liquidity, price discovery and market design.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions"><span class="button button-closed" aria-label="Paper submissions are closed">Submissions closed</span><a class="hero-text-link" href="#about">Discover the workshop <span>↓</span></a></div>
